OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 DEC
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: John Rutter
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod speaks to John
OL,6,     GRutter about his extraordinary
OL,7,     Gmusical life in his 80th birthday
OL,8,     Gyear. Today, John reflects on
OL,9,     Gcomposing during life's most
OL,10,     Gdifficult times.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GHarpist Claire Jones and tenor Ed
OL,13,     GLyon.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,17,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,18,     GThe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,19,     Gcelebrates its 90th anniversary
OL,20,     Gwith music by Grieg, Tippett and
OL,21,     GAyanna Witter-Johnson, with the
OL,22,     Ghelp of pianist Sir Stephen Hough.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
